    "description": "# napari-lumic-cci\n\nA napari plugin for spectral unmixing with the LUMIC backend.\n\n## Installation\n\nThe plugin currently targets Python 3.12. From the repository root, install\nthe plugin and its dependencies, including Lumic:\n\n```bash\npython -m pip install --pre ./Python/plugin\npython -m pip install \"napari[pyqt6]\"\n```\n\nThe `--pre` option allows pip to install the current Lumic release candidate.\nThe second command supplies a Qt binding if the environment does not have one.\n\n## Usage\n\nLaunch napari with `python -m napari`, then open **Plugins \u2192 LUMIC CCI-GU \u2192\nSpectral Unmixing**.\n",
